ABOUT FORKS ON GITHUB

While this repository is public, GitHub's Terms of Service let any GitHub
user fork it through GitHub's own interface, and nothing here overrides that.
What this licence withholds is the right to publish, distribute or release
anything built from such a fork. A fork kept for reading or for a private
change is fine; shipping one is not.


OTHER PEOPLE'S WORK

This repository contains no part of the VRC Formula Alpha 2026. The car's
physics are read at runtime from the copy each user already owns, and nothing
