NO WARRANTY

This program is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability,
fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement. In no event shall the
author be liable for any claim, damages or other liability arising from the
use of this program.

It writes deployment maps into Assetto Corsa setup files you choose. It makes
a backup copy first, and it changes only deployment maps 1 to 3. Even so, the
setups it touches are yours, and so is the responsibility for keeping copies
of anything you care about.


